      "review_summary": "The PR adds a Discord `mediaUrls` send path that uploads multiple files per message, splits overflow beyond 10 attachments, threads the new input through actions/components/outbound payloads, and updates focused tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +238, Tests +131. Total +369 across 10 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main is source-reproducible as scalar-only for Discord uploads, and the PR-head blocker is source/CI reproducible through the `loadOutboundMediaFromUrl(params.opts.mediaUrl)` call and the failing `tsgo:prod` log.",
      "review_followup": "- [P2] A narrow automated repair can replace the stale scalar loader argument with `componentMediaUrl` and add one focused regression test; choosing between parallel candidate PRs remains maintainer judgment.",
